Z||000000||SwissFormula||12-24-2001||07:39 AM||||my formula is in need of a new pair of shoes, and i have found some really nice ones:   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Konig_Imagine_Black.jpg">  <BR>König Imagine<P>17x7" 40 offset front with 215/45/17 tires<BR>18x7.5" 45 offset rear with 225- or 235/40/18 tires<BR>this should fit without problems - thanx artherd!<BR>although 40 offset rear would be better, but that's the only offsets available.<P><A HREF="http://www.whalentire.com/wheels.cfm" TARGET=_blank>Whalen Tire</A> sells them for a reasonable price and they do ship overseas!<BR>Now the question:<BR><B>Does anyone know them, had a good or bad experience? I want to know who i'm dealing with...</B><BR>it ain't funny to fight with a dumba$$ who claims "nosir, wer sure, its empossable we sent ya da wrong partz" when you're on the other side of a large ocean, two silver & two black rims lying on the floor in front of you...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif"><P>thanx & merry Xmas!<P>------------------<BR>Roy<P>88 Formula, T-Top<BR>1 of 20 Fieros in Switzerland<p>[This message has been edited by SwissFormula (edited 12-24-2001).]||||reg||5
